      "text": "Rakan gains 75% Move Speed for 4 seconds. Rakan deals (100/200/300 + (50% Ability Power)) magic damage and Charms enemies for 1/1.25/1.5 second(s) the first time he touches them. The first champion touched grants Rakan 150% decaying Move Speed.",
